Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:29.00,staff,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(93,803)}时间 {\fs70\c&HFFFFFF&}臭屁匠\N\N{\fs60\c&H0A8FC7&}压制 {\fs70\c&HFFFFFF&}娜夏
